{"id":"master-red-403x404","parent":"infra-tests","ord":"aO","title":"Master's end-to-end tests fail: two PRs that each passed alone collide #now #bug","done":"2026-08-26T09:53:41-04:00","desc":"The collision: the typed fixture declares `merge` as `type: ref` with a child `human` TITLED \"the human merges\"; #403's meaning socket draws a titled reference by its title (deliberately — the ruled face); #404's scenario (\"A moved key refuses before the typed gate's work is spent\") asserts the chip's value text === \"human\" — the pre-#403 face. One stale assertion. The fix (PR #407, pi, one line + comment): the row asserts the FACE (\"the human merges\"), the file assertion keeps the stored id (\"merge\" set to \"human\") — both truths split at the seam. The fixture deliberately untouched: shortening the variant's title would make face == id and the assertion could never again bite a face regression. Green ×3 locally.\n\n**Review round WAIVED by the orchestrator (best judgment, documented per the overnight standing): master red + a one-line test-assertion diff + the scenario's own author + the orchestrator read the diff as the check.** CI once, auto-merge on green. The same-afternoon-merges lesson from master-red-meta-merge repeats: individually-green PRs into adjacent code want a cross-check at the merged head.","created":"2026-08-26T09:39:04-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:09-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","dispatched":"2026-08-26T09:42:00-04:00","from":"#405's author, 2026-08-26 09:37 — proved on a throwaway origin/master worktree, 3/3 failures at typed_properties.feature:78; its own diff byte-identical on the touched files","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/5efc01417c30e16f34a044b2df626fdfca846ab8","merged":"2026-08-26T09:58:00-04:00","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/407","terminal":"939e969d"}}
{"id":"codeql-fsrace-406","parent":"infra-tests","ord":"aP","title":"Three HIGH CodeQL alerts (js/file-system-race) rode #406 past the gate — CodeQL wasn't required; now it is #bug","done":"2026-08-26T10:42:18-04:00","desc":"The three flagged sites are tools.test.ts lines 2652, 2656 and 2657: fixtures that make a file look old by writing it and then setting its timestamp with `utimesSync`, which CodeQL reads as a file-system race (one program's check-then-act on a path another program could change in between).\n\nThe gate was fixed first, so this cannot happen again: CodeQL is now the tenth required check in the branch-protection ruleset, and the lane-closing checklist now queries code-scanning alerts explicitly. This lane cleans up master itself.\n\nThe pi agent is writing it. Whatever the fixtures were actually testing — a file that appears stale — must still be tested once the race is closed.","created":"2026-08-26T10:25:53-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:09-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","dispatched":"2026-08-26T10:32:00-04:00","from":"the human, 2026-08-26 — caught on #406's review tab; the orchestrator's green gate read --required only, and CodeQL reported as a bot review outside it","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/ea20fb03b21b4a3c3f1f1d8bef50dde342a4879a","merged":"2026-08-26T10:40:00-04:00","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/409","terminal":"e2995dba","worktree":".worktrees/codeql-fsrace-406"}}
{"id":"no-file-delete-op","ord":"b03","title":"No op deletes a document or emptied outline #bug","done":"2026-08-31T14:30:20-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T11:20:54-04:00","worked":11366,"desc":"create_document/create_outline mint files; write_document rewrites; empty_trash deletes trashed NODES — but nothing deletes a FILE. Surfaced by the orchestrator-file consolidation: orchestrator/instructions.md (tombstoned) and orchestrator/supervision.olai (emptied by move_node) both await a manual rm, which the board-writes-only-through-ops rule otherwise forbids. Wanted: a delete verb for documents and empty outlines (refusing non-empty ones), routed through Trash semantics if possible.","created":"2026-08-26T20:06:14-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T14:30:20-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","brief":"briefs/file-delete-op.md","dispatched":"2026-08-31T11:32:00-04:00","kolu-terminal":"7cf67c42","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/10e0bc93","merged":"2026-08-31","odu-worktree":".worktrees/file-delete-op","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/449","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 1h36m (pi, 2 compactions) · refactor 23m · reviews 9m/10m parallel · address 29m (compaction 3) · re-verdicts 2m/3m · ci 5m · close <1m — TOTAL ~2h58m (11:32→14:30)"}}
