{"id":"lane-suphint-review-a","parent":"superseded-hint-upstream","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok #bug","done":"2026-08-28T12:47:12-04:00","after":["lane-suphint-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-28T11:03:15-04:00","changed":"2026-08-28T12:47:15-04:00","custom":{"reviewer":"agent-grok","terminal":"97eab6da","verdict":"HOLD — no MUST, but \"do not merge on the inference's word until the refusal edges are tests\": a unique last-touched sibling is stamped even when it is not the session /clear ended (wrong link on the ordinary two-conversations-one-cwd shape); the >= boundary walks past a same-timestamp predecessor into an older guess; tie/undated/no-candidate edges untested. NITs: unbounded facts cache, memo key weaker than its header claims, listed-then-gone race stamps 0, patch-apply loudness. PR comment 5455233369."}}
{"id":"lane-suphint-review-b","parent":"superseded-hint-upstream","ord":"a3","title":"review: claude-opus #bug","done":"2026-08-28T12:47:15-04:00","after":["lane-suphint-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-28T11:03:15-04:00","changed":"2026-08-28T13:18:19-04:00","custom":{"reviewer":"agent-claude-opus","terminal":"149acfa0","verdict":"REQUEST CHANGES. MUST 1: an unreadable/deleted/zero-byte transcript stamps \"0 messages\" (getSessionMessages returns [] instead of throwing — the null chain never sees the case it exists for, and clearedAt is silently lost too). MUST 2: wrong-link directions — unconditional overwrite lets a second claimant erase the first, no recency bound names an arbitrarily old sibling, and includeProgrammatic:true admits headless/SDK sessions as candidates. SHOULDs: the link rides undeclared SessionMessage.timestamp (silent NaN on a pin bump), cold-list cost unmeasured + failures cached permanently + key degrades without fileSize, zero tests on the inference. NITs: patch fuzz needs -F0 for the loudness claim, isInteger, \"messages\" counts tool rows, byId cross-agent keying. PR comment 5455220312."}}
