{"id":"inbox-count-empty-header","parent":"feat-nav","ord":"aS","title":"PR: the Inbox badge counts marks, and capture mints a todo #bug","done":"2026-08-29T14:50:10-04:00","desc":"RULED (the human, 2026-08-29 ~13:10, after the walkthrough): the badge counts the rows marked todo/doing in the Inbox — full stop, any depth, no walk — and capture mints `todo` instead of a bare bullet so captures stay visible. Kills the emptied-header bug with no special clause, and deletes the #348/#351 awaiting filter. Accepted behavior change: existing bare-bullet captures stop counting. Single PR, auto-merge on review folded + CI green + frame-verified visuals (0 → capture → 1 → done → 0).\n\nSECOND RULING (the human, 2026-08-29 ~14:19, from opus's MUST): the Agenda composition is KEPT AND STATED — an agent/terminal capture (date-stamped) is a thing the human owes: it sits on that day's Agenda and shows OVERDUE from the next morning. The PR body and docs (editing.md's born-todo sentence, running.md:270's stale never-overdue line) say it plainly.","created":"2026-08-29T13:03:29-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:00-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","brief":"briefs/inbox-count-marks.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T13:12:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","musts":"1","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/429","reviewer":"agent-grok","shoulds":"4","terminal":"e92346b6","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 35m (pi) · review(∥) 36m incl. the Agenda ruling (grok+opus) · address+re-verdict 24m (pi/opus) · ci 9m (claude-ci) · close <1m — TOTAL 1h37m (13:12→14:49)","worktree":".worktrees/inbox-count-marks"}}
