{"id":"lane-pfv-review","parent":"per-file-validation","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok #bug","done":"2026-08-29T23:08:27-04:00","started":"2026-08-29T22:23:42-04:00","after":["lane-pfv-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-29T20:49:16-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T23:08:27-04:00","custom":{"musts":"2","reviewer":"agent-grok","shoulds":"2","terminal":"6b44e6c7","verdict":"MUST-FIX ×2 — the ruling holds on the happy path (per-file verified at every axis, the errors-only face, the dangling edges, the deleted page's reachability). MUST 1: the #439 semantic conflict (this PR deletes admits/implicatedIn that #439's store clause rides; merge-tree conflicts across six files; the reviewer prescribes: keep this PR's success-arm stopping + #439's planner gate, rewrite blockerOf against blamed). MUST 2: reportOf strips every guess-while-unreadable code when ANY file fails to decode — a bad-prop washed out publishes a live writable file carrying refused values, the opposite of #439's promise; narrow the guess to the ref/node/under arms. +2 SHOULDs +2 NITs. Comment 5466253716."}}
