{"id":"lane-fdo-review-a","parent":"no-file-delete-op","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok #bug","done":"2026-08-31T14:19:02-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T14:15:03-04:00","worked":894,"after":["lane-fdo-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-31T11:20:54-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T14:19:02-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"c30b9bd7","musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-grok","shoulds":"1","verdict":"Approve with SHOULD at web/client/file/delete.ts:22 — the delete gate verified as ONE path through ops and the apply-with-delete refusal probed whole; the confirming question uses the shorter git phrasing that lies on --commit=off / unversioned serves (the phrasing empty_trash already rejected). Comment 5482160935.","verdict-followup":"re-verdict at 77e65bc1: the confirming question is honest under every serve state — the SHOULD closed. Comment 5482577426."}}
{"id":"lane-fdo-review-b","parent":"no-file-delete-op","ord":"a3","title":"review: claude-opus #bug","done":"2026-08-31T14:19:55-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T14:15:03-04:00","worked":1030,"after":["lane-fdo-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-31T11:20:54-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T14:19:55-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"c4dafed8","musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-claude-opus","shoulds":"4","verdict":"Approve with 4 SHOULDs — git-as-undo argued and true, pins/mirrors/validator claims check out. SHOULDs: plan.ts:5633 the document-naming refusal is the layer's one uncapped list; plans.golden.test.ts:197 delete is the only PLANNERS entry with no golden row and the coverage test reads SCRIPT so it passes silent; disk.ts:436 unlink without force:true misreports a race as failure; store.test.ts:1059 the second-removal test pins the generic stale check, nothing removal-specific. NITs: the article ternary, a stale sibling pin, the unused e2e step for no-delete-affordance, prose slips. Comment 5482177307.","verdict-followup":"re-verdict at 77e65bc1: all four SHOULDs closed and every actionable NIT in (both e2e gaps as real scenarios); one of its own nits withdrawn as wrong; two non-blocking residuals noted (the golden harness's bare corpus, an unused page-mark); the environmental claim read-consistent, neither failing file touched by the branch. Comment 5482584491."}}
