{"id":"task-notification-spill","parent":"feat-chat","ord":"ah","title":"PR: task notifications stop spilling raw #bug","done":"2026-09-01T19:06:41-04:00","desc":"An async subagent's completion notification is drawn RAW in the chat panel: inline in the main column, markdown unrendered (literal heading markers, collapsed newlines), instead of the one-row task ending + folded report docs/chat.md promises.\n\n**The verified chain (2026-09-01):** the harness injects a `user`-role turn whose content is one raw string — the `<task-notification>` XML with the subagent's whole report inside — stamped `origin.kind: \"task-notification\"` (real human turns carry `origin.kind: \"human\"`; session 2a3c4d88 line 1353). olai's log shows the notifications riding the ordinary prompt path (`prompt sent`/`turn ended` at 19:00:23, 19:01:16, 19:05:19 UTC). The panel drew the payload as-is (the human's screenshot).\n\n**The bug in one sentence:** the discriminator exists in the session data and nothing downstream reads it.\n\n**The fix's home:** the pinned adapter, where the label is readable — classify `origin.kind: \"task-notification\"` turns and deliver them as the task-ending row with the report folded under the spawning row; panel work only if a new chunk kind is needed. Repro is trivial: spawn an async agent from an olai chat. The #456-verified task vocabulary (Monitor, background-Bash) is the pattern to extend.","created":"2026-09-01T15:57:48-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:11-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/task-notification-spill.md","dispatched":"2026-09-01T16:35:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-01 ~16:00, with a screenshot; verified same hour from this conversation's transcript + olai's service log","kolu-terminal":"11e565c0","merge":"merge-auto","odu-worktree":".worktrees/task-notification-spill","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/459","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement ~30m (opencode→grok on the kimi 400s) · refactor 22m · review 2 rounds 14m (opus) · address 16m + docs nit & merge-master 5m · ci 4m20s all green, e2e 1038/1038 · dispatch→merge 2h31m"}}
