{"id":"lane-tns-evidence","parent":"task-notification-spill","ord":"a6","title":"evidence verified #bug","done":"2026-09-01T19:06:11-04:00","desc":"FRAME-VERIFIED by the orchestrator (2026-09-01 19:05): three saatchi shots, and the two that matter are the counter-shot to the human's original screenshot. (a) The completion — the person's own bubble holds ONLY their words (\"subagent notify\"), the spawn row is FOLDED with the harness sentence, the one-row news sits at the bottom, and there is NO XML anywhere in the column. (b) The report inside the spawn's fold, rendered as REAL MARKDOWN — \"Findings\" a proper heading, prose as prose, the JSON in a code block — where the bug drew literal # markers with collapsed newlines in the main column.","after":["lane-tns-ci"],"created":"2026-09-01T15:59:46-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T19:06:11-04:00"}
