{"id":"queued-command-no-bubble","parent":"feat-chat","ord":"aj","title":"A queued-command attachment draws no bubble on reopen #bug","todo":true,"desc":"The footnote of the retired Inbox item `await-queued-replay` (2026-09-02): a message steered into a running turn is stored by the CLI as a `queued_command` attachment, and the panel's replay draws only messages — so on reopening the conversation that steer has no bubble. Unverified since the 0.73.0 adapter bump (#468); the swallow it was found beside is cured. Check it still reproduces before dispatch.","see":["adapter-bump-73"],"created":"2026-09-02T14:03:00-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:11-04:00"}
{"id":"contract-reinjected-on-reopen","parent":"feat-chat","ord":"ak","title":"PR: the node-agent contract is taught once, not on every reopen #bug","done":"2026-09-02T18:32:31-04:00","started":"2026-09-02T14:14:13-04:00","worked":15498,"desc":"Spotted by the human 2026-09-02 ~14:05 ET on the team deploy (an opencode/kimi-k3 conversation ASSIGNED to the \"Xyne Spaces bot\" node): after a redeploy, the next message they sent into the existing chat carried the `[olai] This conversation has been ASSIGNED…` preamble again. docs/chat.md's promise is the opposite: the contract rides the FIRST message only, is written down under `~/.local/state/olai/heard/`, and neither a second message nor a restart repeats it. CAUSE (the author, #476): the assigned mark was written synchronously but the taught mark was a detached fork behind an already-published notice — a lost write meant a second teaching; the fix gates the notice on the mark's own write. SESSION 2 (2026-09-02 ~16:25 ET): session 1 corrupted with a raw kimi token spill mid-evidence, after pushing the master merge (c9f11d14) and a POST-APPROVAL commit 08cdddbc (the review's ordering pin caught its race on the first run after the merge; the mark now rides the delivery's first act) — killed and respawned fresh in the same worktree. That commit is unreviewed: the claude-opus re-verdict at 08cdddbc runs beside the evidence, before CI.","see":["node-agents-p3","node-agents-p1"],"created":"2026-09-02T14:04:13-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:11-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/contract-taught-once.md","dispatched":"2026-09-02T14:10:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-02 ~14:05 ET, with a screenshot of the Xyne Spaces bot conversation on the team deploy","kolu-terminal":"2c1bc116","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/0632b28c","merged":"2026-09-02","musts":"1","odu-worktree":".worktrees/contract-taught-once","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/476","shoulds":"9","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 1h19m red-first (opencode) · review 9m + re-verdict 5m (claude-opus) · address 11m · merge-master + post-approval commit 23m, session lost · re-verdict 7m · SHOULDs + evidence attempt 1h25m, second session lost · evidence 13m43s + master merge (grok) · re-verdict 5m + notes 4m · ci 6m 11/11 · merge <1m — TOTAL 4h22m (14:10 → 18:32 ET)"}}
