{"id":"unassigned-door-fresh-vault","parent":"feat-chat","ord":"am","title":"PR: the Unassigned row is reachable in a fresh vault #bug","done":"2026-09-03T06:32:42-04:00","started":"2026-09-02T21:36:11-04:00","worked":32191,"desc":"Found by pi while driving panel-live.ts section 7 on #478 (2026-09-02), accepted by the human as a chat bug: the sidebar's `agent-unassigned` row draws only when unassigned or unreachable conversations exist, and the listing behind it is asked ONCE at provider mount (packages/web/src/client/agents/answered.tsx) — the only re-ask is pressing the very row whose drawing needs a non-empty answer. In a fresh vault, or after the first conversation is created in a tab that mounted empty, the door never appears. Reproduced twice at HEAD, with or without #478. Fix shape is the author's; the acceptance test is panel-live section 7 passing in its own fresh vault.","see":["node-agents-p3"],"created":"2026-09-02T17:13:52-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:56:11-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-opencode","brief":"briefs/unassigned-fresh-vault.md","dispatched":"2026-09-02T21:40:00-04:00","from":"pi's finding on olai#478, 2026-09-02; ruled a chat bug by the human ~17:15 ET","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/aba2314d","merged":"2026-09-03","musts":"2","odu-worktree":".worktrees/unassigned-fresh-vault","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/482","shoulds":"2","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 38m red-first (opencode) · review 7m24s (claude-opus, 2 MUST 2 SHOULD) · address 24m · re-verdict 4m · ci 2 runs ~13m (a committing red from the counting pin, fixed 22m) · parked overnight ~7h · merge <1m — TOTAL ~8h50m (21:40 → 06:31 ET), ~1h50m worked"}}
