{"id":"pcw-implement","parent":"prop-op-conditional-was","ord":"a0","title":"Add the previous-value guard to the property write operation, on both the browser and the agent face — then open the pull request #feature","done":"2026-08-25T22:19:44-04:00","created":"2026-08-25T21:19:52-04:00","changed":"2026-08-27T19:05:06-04:00","custom":{"pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/404","terminal":"ea8018e9"}}
