{"id":"orch-p2a-feed","parent":"orch-p2-events","ord":"a0","title":"PR: kolu events become visible — the watcher, _olai/Kolu.olai, and the recent-events feed #feature","done":"2026-08-29T08:30:27-04:00","desc":"Phase A of the reshaped design: olai's server computes attention events (waiting/awaiting held past threshold, nags) from the mirror it already holds, configured live by _olai/Kolu.olai (watch thresholds + mutes; defaults when absent), shown as a recent-events feed behind the header's kolu pill in the existing Dock vocabulary. NO conversation delivery — the orchestrator's Monitor runs in parallel as the acceptance soak before phase B switches delivery.\n\nRULED at the gate (the human, 2026-08-28 ~19:35, from the prototype at projects/olai/prototypes/pill-mock.png): watcher liveness is a STATUS, not an event — the kolu pill carries it (quiet when the pulse is fresh, recency in the hover; AMBER-loud when overdue: \"kolu · watcher quiet Nm\"), heartbeats leave the feed entirely (the ring holds attention events only). The color ruling with it: violet stays reserved for an agent blocked on you; AMBER is the new infrastructure-warning register — the watcher is the second kind.","created":"2026-08-28T16:29:28-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T08:30:29-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","brief":"briefs/kolu-events-feed.md","dispatched":"2026-08-28T16:28:00-04:00","merge":"merge-human","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/2ecc76d1","merged":"2026-08-29T08:30:00-04:00","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/421","terminal":"f4729682","tier":"ordinary","worktree":".worktrees/kolu-events-feed"}}
