{"id":"header-uptime","parent":"feat-orch","ord":"aE","title":"PR: server uptime in the header #feature","done":"2026-08-29T11:38:34-04:00","desc":"The human, 2026-08-29, after the 09:31 surprise restart (a SIGTERM nothing in the UI showed): a quiet header chip saying how long the server has been up — the value once over the wire, ticked locally, the hover carrying the exact start instant. A fresh \"up 12s\" after a reconnect IS the restart signal the journal had to provide today.","created":"2026-08-29T09:34:59-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T11:38:34-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/header-uptime.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T09:38:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/423","terminal":"1f68b73a","tier":"ordinary","worktree":".worktrees/header-uptime"}}
