{"id":"chat-node-landing","parent":"feat-chat","ord":"aL","title":"PR: chat node links select the row instead of zooming #feature","done":"2026-08-29T13:48:06-04:00","desc":"The human, 2026-08-29: a node link clicked in chat should SELECT, not zoom. On the open page: focus.ts's existing behavior — on-screen + the caret-row accent, no editor, no route change. Elsewhere: open the node's FILE page and LAND on the row selected — the outline arm gains the landing treatment documents already have (landing.ts's one-shot, per-pane, reader-takeover act; opensAt currently drops an outline fragment and names the hole). `/#id` keeps meaning zoom — the durable location-free permalink for pins.","created":"2026-08-29T11:08:33-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T13:48:06-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-pi","brief":"briefs/chat-node-landing.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T11:09:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/428","terminal":"51f6a9d8","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 1h4m (pi) · refactor 12m (pi) · review(∥) 12m (grok+opus) · address+residue 42m (pi) · ci 27m incl. one real red + two infra deaths (claude-ci) · close <1m — TOTAL 2h38m (11:09→13:47)","worktree":".worktrees/chat-node-landing"}}
