{"id":"orch-odu","parent":"feat-orch","ord":"aF","title":"Odu — the CI integration family (live properties; claude-ci retires at its end)","desc":"The human's design session 2026-08-29 (brainstorming/odu-in-olai.md — the rulings baked): olai becomes the CI surface the way it became the fleet surface. Originally four PRs; odu's thin client (merged, odu#94) and olai's live-properties seam + run face (merged, olai#433) landed as ruled, and the human COLLAPSED phases 3+4 into ONE olai PR (2026-09-01): events through the second doorbell (first-red + settle, both ruled) AND odu's own MCP attached to conversations — no bespoke verbs. Where the seam needs an odu change, that odu PR dispatches SEPARATELY IN PARALLEL and the olai PR uses it directly (the odu#94 → olai#433 pin pattern). claude-ci retires when it ships — process edits per THE BAN, on the human's approval then. Discovery stays board-driven (the lane's worktree → .ci/odu.sock).","created":"2026-08-29T15:24:28-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:55:58-04:00"}
