{"id":"lane-cab-ci","parent":"chat-adapter-bump","ord":"a5","title":"CI green at head #feature","done":"2026-09-01T11:44:25-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T11:34:35-04:00","worked":590,"desc":"CI-watcher seat for THIS lane: **grok**, not claude-ci (the human, 2026-09-01 — Claude hit its weekly limit ~11:15, resets 1am; author seat switched to grok the same beat). Grok has no MCP-attach flag, so the watcher drives odu via its CLI faces per orchestrator/ci-watcher.md; venue law unchanged (olai PR — either platform green is the bar).","after":["lane-cab-merge-master","lane-cab-address"],"created":"2026-08-31T21:04:20-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T11:44:25-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"6c983c66","odu-worktree":".worktrees/chat-adapter-bump","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/456"}}
{"id":"lane-cab-evidence","parent":"chat-adapter-bump","ord":"a6","title":"evidence verified #feature","done":"2026-09-01T11:45:13-04:00","desc":"No visual surface changed, so no screenshot was owed: the lane's evidence is the PR body's MEASURED tables — the background-task lifecycle proven on all three kinds against the built pin, the /clear supersession pairing run end-to-end on a real directory, and #1039's own repro script run verbatim (still hangs, so the guard stays). Both reviewers verified these by independent measurement (grok: byte-identical patch lines 436/436; pi: live steer over a running background Bash + SDK type read). Frame-verified by reading — the evidence is wire truth, not pixels.","after":["lane-cab-ci"],"created":"2026-08-31T21:04:20-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T11:45:13-04:00"}
