{"id":"lane-cab-review-b","parent":"chat-adapter-bump","ord":"a2V","title":"review: pi #feature","done":"2026-09-01T10:51:29-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T10:04:05-04:00","worked":2844,"desc":"Approve, and it did the ONE thing reading could not settle. grok's review flagged a shape gap in the Monitor evidence: the repro waits for the arming turn's PROMPT to return, so a measured background task is only POSSIBLY still live at steer time, and the committed table cannot say which. pi spent its probe there — armed `Bash(run_in_background: \"sleep 900\")`, steered 13.7s into the second turn **while the bash was unambiguously still running**, and the steered prompt settled `end_turn` at 15.3s. So the negative holds on the reading that matters to the ruling: a background Bash LIVE at the steer does not wedge settlement, and the refusal to widen the guard on a guess is measured safe rather than hopeful.\n\nIt also closed a layer no diff covered: the lockfile moves `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk` 0.3.220 → 0.3.232 with the adapter, which the \"no task vocabulary in the 1572-line dist diff\" evidence cannot see at all. It read both SDKs and found the task message types byte-identical and the `SessionMessage` mapper still carrying the undocumented `timestamp` passthrough — so that survival is alive in the library that OWNS it, not merely in one live run.\n\nAnd it caught the branch minting a NEW false self-description while fixing an old one: the sentence added to make a README honest claims `docs/chat.md` \"cites no source path anywhere in it\", which that file contradicts twice over.","after":["lane-cab-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-31T21:05:55-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T10:51:29-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"23504162","musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-pi","shoulds":"2"}}
{"id":"odu-doorbell","parent":"orch-odu","ord":"a2","title":"PR: CI joins the conversation #feature","done":"2026-09-01T18:31:02-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T12:57:04-04:00","worked":20038,"desc":"Phases 3+4 of the family, COLLAPSED INTO ONE PR by the human 2026-09-01 (\"Both must land in same PR\"). Two halves:\n\n**The doorbell** — run events ring the CONVERSATION through the second doorbell (#450), two kinds ruled in so many words: first-red (once per run, the moment any node goes red) and settle (verdict, counts, failed recipes with log paths; rerun-went-green named from the record). Scope derives from the lanes file's `odu-worktree` props exactly as the chip already licenses.\n\n**The tools** — odu's OWN MCP attached to conversations the way kolu's is: `run`, `node_rerun`, `node_cancel`, `wait_for_settle`, `lease`/`release` become the conversation agent's, so the orchestrator initiates CI runs itself. The per-checkout gap (`odu mcp` binds to cwd; a conversation spans lanes) is the author's design decision — and if the clean seam needs an odu change, that is a STOP-AND-ASK: the human ruled upstream odu PRs dispatch SEPARATELY IN PARALLEL and this PR uses the odu PR directly (the odu#94 → olai#433 pin pattern).\n\nclaude-ci's retirement is NOT in the PR — a process change on the human's approval after it ships.\n\n**Seat note:** the family's baked ruling names claude-opus the author; Claude's weekly limit is out until 1am, and the human ordered dispatch now — pi takes the seat (the complex-proven kimi author; the tie-breaker rule: a wrong turn costs a fix round, and the double review catches it). Reviewers per the pi-authored rule: BOTH grok and claude-opus — the opus round lands after the 1am reset if the lane is still open.","created":"2026-09-01T12:57:04-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T18:31:02-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/odu-doorbell.md","dispatched":"2026-09-01T12:56:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-01 ~12:30: notify on BOTH first-red and settle; delivery via the second doorbell","kolu-terminal":"4b5a3fb6","merge":"merge-human","odu-worktree":".worktrees/odu-doorbell","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/458","tier":"design-heavy","timings":"implement 3 sessions (pi×2 died on outages, grok finished) · refactor 9m + address ~30m incl human mark/link/DRY round + CI reds + evidence 10m (grok) · review pi 20m 2 rounds · ci both rounds (claude-ci) · dispatch→merge 5h34m"}}
