{"id":"lane-odb-address","parent":"odu-doorbell","ord":"a5","title":"address findings #feature","done":"2026-09-01T18:14:25-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T17:54:32-04:00","worked":3244,"desc":"Round 1 took pi's six findings (closed at 5ddd50f5). Round 2 (doing) is THE HUMAN'S SCOPE, added mid-lane and steered once (~17:25 and ~17:30): (a) the odu plugin ships odu's OWN mark in chat, overruling the PR's no-mark design decision; (b) odu wake messages LINK TO THE NODE they are about, kolu's own spelling; (c) the mark pipeline and subject-as-link composition get a hickey extraction into the common layer — second tenant now exists, so the mechanism is said once and a future plugin's author never gets browbeaten for either; (d) pi's honest gap (no test pins the minted coalesce key) taken if cheap. Stop-and-ask stands if odu itself must export the logo. Named here so the address span is not misread as a slow agent.","after":["lane-odb-review-a","lane-odb-review-b"],"created":"2026-09-01T12:57:04-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T18:14:25-04:00"}
