{"id":"plugin-spaces-mirror","parent":"orch-spaces","ord":"a0","title":"PR: the fleet reports into team chat #feature","done":"2026-09-02T14:21:10-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T16:30:11-04:00","worked":78659,"desc":"Phase 1 \"Mirror\" of the Xyne Spaces Bot family — a new `olai-plugin-xyne-spaces` posts the orchestrator's digest into the team channel: doorbell digests at the ruled level (~5–8/PR, one thread per lane, CI message edited in place), orchestrator replies TRIMMED to ~500 chars (ruled), agentProgress during turns. Watch-only — no webhook route, nothing received. Secrets in env (OLAI_SPACES_URL/TOKEN); binding + knobs in the plugin's claimed `_olai/Spaces.olai` — CONFIG-FILE binding this PR, the picker UI a follow-up (ruled). The human reuses their existing kolu Spaces app identity (ruled). Tests against a fake Spaces; the LIVE test is the human's own deploy — hence merge-human (their word: \"I'll deploy and test first\"). Author grok on their word, with the kimi pool down; claude-opus reviews after the 1am reset.","created":"2026-09-01T16:13:57-04:00","changed":"2026-09-02T14:21:10-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","approved":"2026-09-02T14:22:00-04:00","brief":"briefs/plugin-spaces-mirror.md","dispatched":"2026-09-01T17:20:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-01: layer-3 phase 1, ruled via question tool — watch-only, one channel per team, digest verbosity","kolu-terminal":"5a6f3f71","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/c18013f0","merged":"2026-09-02","odu-worktree":".worktrees/spaces-mirror","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/460","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 27m47s (grok) · refactor 15m50s · review 37m43s (claude-opus) · address 1h09m · evidence 4m18s · ci 35m39s · the human's deploy-and-test hold ~18h10m (their own fixes + CI at f125a63) · merge <1m — TOTAL ~20h57m (09-01 17:20 → 09-02 14:17 ET)"}}
{"id":"orch-spaces","parent":"feat-orch","ord":"aH","title":"Xyne Spaces Bot — the team-chat family","desc":"Layer 3 of the human's three-layer frame (2026-09-01): each team's Kolu+Olai fleet reports into (and later takes orders from) the team's Xyne Spaces channel. Design record: brainstorming/layer3-spaces-chat.md (fact-grounded in the Spaces source; the whole feature set needs zero Spaces PRs) + the two prototypes in projects/olai/prototypes/ (layer3-mirror.html — the channel; layer3-mirror-olai.html — the olai side). Ruled 2026-09-01: watch-only first, one channel per team with a thread per lane, digest verbosity. The phases are the PR items below, in order.","created":"2026-09-01T16:30:01-04:00","changed":"2026-09-06T15:55:58-04:00"}
