{"id":"lane-psm-ci","parent":"plugin-spaces-mirror","ord":"a5","title":"CI green at head #feature","done":"2026-09-01T20:12:55-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T20:03:01-04:00","worked":2139,"desc":"DOGFOOD ROUND (the human's word, 2026-09-01 night) — SETTLED ALL GREEN: the orchestrator launched and followed the run itself (odu CLI, kolu-ci-9 leased from the pool; ci-5 busy, ci-8 unreachable and skipped), no order to claude-ci, the warm watcher (47f48008) idle throughout. 11/11 at head 914558f7 — e2e the long pole at 4m57s, test 1m38s — verified against GitHub's own statuses (success, 11 contexts), never the run's claim. The lingering coordinator was reaped by `odu cancel` after the settle; its exit 130 is the cancel's, not a red. What the round proves for the retire question: launch + follow + verdict all worked from the orchestrator's own hands with no watcher seat; what it could NOT prove is the MCP tools half (this conversation was handed none — the root cause and fix lane are odu-baked-in). The earlier green of 2026-09-01 evening stands as this step's original settle.","after":["lane-psm-merge-master","lane-psm-address"],"created":"2026-09-01T16:30:01-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T20:12:55-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"47f48008","odu-worktree":".worktrees/spaces-mirror","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/460"}}
{"id":"lane-psm-evidence","parent":"plugin-spaces-mirror","ord":"a6","title":"evidence verified #feature","done":"2026-09-01T19:21:09-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T19:16:51-04:00","worked":258,"desc":"Verified by the orchestrator (2026-09-01 19:20). No visual surface beyond the header pill, so the automated evidence is the fake-Spaces suite — a real Bun.serve on loopback, never the live instance — pinning postMessage/updateMessage/agentProgress as BYTES ON THE WIRE against the real route's refine, the queue's transient-vs-permanent policy and its cap, the hold's write ordering, and trimTo's code-point boundary. CI green 11/11 at 914558f7 corroborates. THE LIVE TEST IS THE HUMAN'S by design (the brief barred the author from their instance and tokens) — a real Spaces channel, a real digest through the thread — and it is the last thing before their merge word. The PR body's stale round-one suite counts were refreshed at this head in the same pass (xyne-spaces 48, state 10, plugin-api 53, server 425, plugin_docs 8, all 0 fail).","after":["lane-psm-ci"],"created":"2026-09-01T16:30:01-04:00","changed":"2026-09-01T19:21:09-04:00"}
