{"id":"node-agents-p1","parent":"chat-subjects","ord":"a0","title":"PR: the agents roster and the switching #feature","done":"2026-09-02T08:11:19-04:00","started":"2026-09-01T17:08:41-04:00","worked":54158,"desc":"Node agents phase 1 (the ruled slice): the AGENTS sidebar roster over `prop:agent`, the door + last message on agent rows, the right panel switching with the node-first header, session binding via machine state, and the subtree-memory teaching for agent-associated sessions (the keystone, ruled into this phase). No assign UI, no Unassigned, no derived wakes, no spawning — phases 2–4. Design: brainstorming/node-agents.md + the prototype. claude-opus authors on the human's word (design-heavy — a new panel surface over the chat seam); NOTE: dispatched while the weekly limit may still hold until 1am — if the first turn refuses, the session parks and is nudged at reset. Reviewer: pi at fold time.","created":"2026-09-01T17:08:41-04:00","changed":"2026-09-02T08:11:19-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","brief":"briefs/node-agents-roster.md","dispatched":"2026-09-01T17:15:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-01 ~17:12: dispatch phase 1 to Claude Opus, manual merge","kolu-terminal":"3ce0b574","merge":"merge-human","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/3625e167","merged":"2026-09-02","odu-worktree":".worktrees/node-agents-roster","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/461","tier":"design-heavy","timings":"implement ~2h25m · refactor ~35m · pi reviews ×3 ~45m · the human-ruled amendment rounds ~3h30m worked · ci ×3 greens ~7m each · merge <1m on the human's approval — TOTAL ~19h (09-01 17:15 → 09-02 08:12 ET)"}}
