{"id":"doorbell-undecided-at-start","parent":"orch-odu","ord":"a9","title":"The CI status plugin rings \"ended without deciding\" as a run starts #feature","todo":true,"desc":"Seen 2026-09-03 00:54 ET on #484's run at 267fa616: the orchestrator launched `run` at 00:55 ET (MCP answered started); within a minute the odu watcher rang \"CI ended without deciding … the run is `pipeline`, settled\" — while the coordinator was alive (pid up, 25s old), the run directory freshly made, the lease being acquired (\"checking for a cached agent\"), no node dealt yet, and odu's ledger empty. The deployed plugin read a just-born run (no nodes, no verdict, a socket that may not yet have answered) as a settled run with no decision. Related: #481's own deferral names the no-node shape; #481's fold reads settle from the run's frames and should not fire on an empty roster. Reproduce against a run that has bound its socket but not yet dealt nodes; the plugin must say nothing until the run has a roster, and \"died\" only when the coordinator is gone.","see":["doorbell-settle-is-socket-death"],"created":"2026-09-03T00:55:20-04:00","custom":{"from":"the orchestrator, 2026-09-03 00:56 ET, on #484's run"}}
{"id":"notes-once-nag-needs-you","parent":"orch-odu","ord":"aA","title":"PR: the chat hears a claimed terminal's changes, and nothing twice #feature","cancelled":"2026-09-03T07:02:27-04:00","desc":"WITHDRAWN by the human 2026-09-03 ~07:05 ET (\"ignore my morning ruling\"): replaced by the finite nag — kolu's watcher repeats a reminder a few times and stops, the count a knob in `_olai/Kolu.olai`, the reminders reaching the chat. See `kolu-nag-count` (the kolu half) and `doorbell-nag-count` (the olai plugin half).\n\nWhat this said (history): olai-plugin-kolu tells the chat when a terminal the selected file claims CHANGES — it stopped, it resumed, it died — one sentence per change, and says nothing otherwise; kolu's periodic nag not forwarded.","see":["doorbell-duplicate-set-note"],"created":"2026-09-03T06:52:38-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T07:02:27-04:00","custom":{"from":"the human 2026-09-03 ~06:57 ET, after rejecting #484"}}
{"id":"doorbell-nag-count","parent":"feat-orch","ord":"aI","title":"PR: the terminal doorbell repeats a reminder a few times, then stops #feature","done":"2026-09-03T17:03:20-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T11:46:55-04:00","worked":18985,"desc":"The olai half of the finite nag (the human, 2026-09-03 ~07:05 ET, reshaped ~08:50 ET): `_olai/Kolu.olai`'s watch node's existing `nag` knob takes the count in the same spelling as the flag, `30m/3` — no new key; olai-plugin-kolu passes it to the watcher and forwards each reminder about a claimed, stopped terminal into the chat up to that count, then says nothing until the terminal changes state. Replaces the withdrawn notes-once rule.\n\nTHE SENTENCE CARRIES THE COUNT (the human, 2026-09-03 ~07:55 ET): every forwarded reminder says which one it is and how many there are — \"reminder 2 of 3\" in plain words — and the last one says it is the last, so the agent knows silence follows. The number comes from kolu's own JSON face; the plugin never counts on its own.\n\nTHE RULING THAT SHAPES THE PR (the human, 2026-09-03 ~11:40 ET, on the orchestrator's finding): today the plugin does NOT subscribe to kolu's watch — it reads the fleet mirror and runs its own held-for, nag and heartbeat timers in `packages/plugins/kolu/src/client/watch.ts` (a deliberate #421 choice). The human chose to SWITCH THE PLUGIN TO KOLU'S WATCH SUBSCRIPTION (padi's `watch.open` / `watchStates` member) so kolu counts and olai only reads `nag.index` and `nag.left` off the event; olai's own three timers go. The kolu pin bump to e2d484659 (#2224, PADI_SURFACE_VERSION 5.6) rides this PR, and the `nag` knob is parsed by kolu's own `parseNag` from `@kolu/padi-client/watchDuration`, not a second grammar.\n\nDISPATCH (the human, 2026-09-03 ~11:31 ET: \"Grok is down so use opencode\"): opencode authors, claude-opus reviews; dispatched 11:42 ET after both #483 (merged 07:21 ET) and kolu #2224 (merged 11:33 ET).","after":["lane-nagc-merge","lane-pae-merge"],"see":["kolu-nag-count","notes-once-nag-needs-you"],"created":"2026-09-03T07:02:27-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T17:03:21-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-opencode","brief":"briefs/doorbell-nag-count.md","dispatched":"2026-09-03T11:43:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-03 ~07:00 ET; supersedes notes-once-nag-needs-you","kolu-terminal":"93e2c7f4","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/8e2043ed","odu-worktree":".worktrees/doorbell-nag-count","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/489","tier":"ordinary"}}
