{"id":"vs-review-grok","parent":"verdict-shape","ord":"a2","title":"Review by the Grok agent (session split off the author's) #infra","done":"2026-08-25T20:17:38-04:00","after":["vs-implement"],"created":"2026-08-25T19:01:12-04:00","changed":"2026-08-27T19:13:23-04:00","custom":{"retired":"2026-08-25T20:20:00-04:00","reviewer":"agent-grok","terminal":"55cf74e3","verdict":"HOLDS on 1 MUST (the tier pin walks 4 literals, not ErrorCode.literals) + 2 SHOULDs (admits-of-a-survivor in the generated arm; the banner's door-to-nowhere) + 1 NIT; axes 2/3/4/5 held incl. his own signed letter. PR comment on #402."}}
