{"id":"git-policy-cli-only","parent":"infra-server","ord":"a9","title":"PR: git policy goes CLI-only — the remembered state files die #infra","done":"2026-08-29T18:57:23-04:00","started":"2026-08-29T17:26:45-04:00","desc":"The human's rulings 2026-08-29 (question tool + follow-up): the server-side remembered-settings layer is removed whole — git commit/push policy = CLI flags (nix module surfaces them) + the built-in defaults (manual/off kept), the panel rows always read-only (kept generic for future read-only instance settings), git.setPolicy dies, the git kind leaves @olai/state. THE REMEMBERED PORT DIES TOO, same PR: --port 0 asks the OS every boot. Stale state files left orphaned (no migration code). The chat kind is user data and stays.","created":"2026-08-29T17:26:41-04:00","changed":"2026-08-29T18:57:23-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/git-policy-cli-only.md","dispatched":"2026-08-29T17:26:00-04:00","merge":"merge-auto","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/59bb10d8","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/434","terminal":"bba23776","tier":"ordinary","timings":"implement 37m (grok) · refactor 13m (grok) · review+re-verdict 24m (opus) · address×2 20m (grok) · ci 11m incl. 5m49s run (claude-ci) · evidence+close 3m — TOTAL 1h33m (17:26→18:59)","worktree":".worktrees/git-policy-cli-only"}}
