{"id":"plugin-system","parent":"infra-build","ord":"a7","title":"PR: kolu and odu become plugins #infra","done":"2026-08-31T11:02:07-04:00","started":"2026-08-30T10:39:32-04:00","worked":87755,"desc":"The human's dispatch 2026-08-30 (~10:45). Design: brainstorming/plugin-system.md, fully ruled — the packages/plugins interface, the generic plugins/&lt;name&gt;/ mount (no plugin words in the core API), plugin-kolu + plugin-odu BOTH extracted in this one PR, property KINDS as data through the format, plugin-owned failure sentences, CLI/nix-only enablement with read-only prefs rows, docs inside the plugin, the fence generalized to two CI lints. Absorbs the odu-in-olai family's phases 3–4. MERGE IS THE HUMAN'S — they review the final API and may order improvement rounds. The author is told to use ultracode workflows for parallel implementation.\n\nTHE API-REVIEW ROUND (2026-08-31, the human live on the deployed unmerged build): the internal tour doc landed, and the human ruled BUILT-IN AUTO-DECLARATION — a plugin claims its conventional keys as data on its kind entries, one fold at the composition root composes effective declarations with the vault's own rows winning, no consumer learns there are two sources, and NOTHING ever writes the user's vault (the orchestrator's hand-added Properties.olai rows were rejected and reverted). AMENDED same morning: plugin-owned names are PREFIXED structurally by the registry — kinds compose as `kolu-terminal`/`odu-worktree` (collision = refusal), the default claimed key equals the prefixed word, and a vault row maps a short key onto the plugin's kind when the user wants one. Author implementing; grok and pi owe a re-verdict round at the new head; CI re-runs at the final head before the human's merge. FOLLOW-UP owed after merge: this board migrates its `terminal`/`worktree` props (and the process files naming them) to the prefixed keys — its own approved beat.","created":"2026-08-30T10:39:32-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T16:42:02-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","brief":"briefs/plugin-system.md","dispatched":"2026-08-30T10:45:00-04:00","kolu-terminal":"303dc985","merge":"merge-human","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/db96ee5c","merged":"2026-08-31","odu-worktree":".worktrees/plugin-system","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/447","tier":"design-heavy","timings":"implement 6h22m (opus, ultracode) · refactor 1h05m · reviews 18m×2 parallel · address 28m · ci 9m · the overnight consumer-gate hold · the morning's api-review rounds (doc, auto-declaration, prefix, micro) with rounds 3–4 · final ci green first-try — TOTAL ~24h20m (08-30 10:45 → 08-31 11:04)"}}
