{"id":"lane-plug-review-a","parent":"plugin-system","ord":"a2","title":"review: grok #infra","done":"2026-08-31T10:44:20-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T10:38:34-04:00","worked":2176,"after":["lane-plug-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-30T10:39:32-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T10:44:20-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"93c693da","musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-grok","shoulds":"1","verdict":"Approve with SHOULD — the cut holds (fence and mechanics are equalities; built≠enabled kept; the licence ships the word; the pin frozen; the residue policy). SHOULD: PluginsMounted and PluginHeaders fold the BUILD roster with no draw-time licence — a disabled plugin still subscribes uncomposed tags (readout degraded) and draws its absent-arm pill; spend running() there as the drawer does. Comment 5472812835.","verdict-followup":"SHOULD holds at fa0471b5 — not running() itself but createComposed(), the right split: draw stays generous, subscribe waits for the roster. Comment 5473052350.","verdict-round3":"Approve with 3 SHOULDs at b631f3b1 — the six claims hold (tableOf prefixes, withClaims the only fold, admits uniform, vault wins); SHOULD 1: standing.ts:166 + tools.ts:291 consult without the vocabulary (NO_KINDS) so ranges on auto-declared keys refuse wrongly; SHOULD 2: the prefix separator is ambiguous — kindWordOf(ab, c-d) == kindWordOf(ab-c, d), the count refuses but the test pins only same-name twins; SHOULD 3: stale pre-round sentences live in plugin-odu docs.md:11, plugin.ts:153, claimants.ts:31, worktrees.ts:43, live-properties.md:12, kinds.ts:104. NITs: doc paste-doubles, meaning.ts:226 example. Comment 5479549008.","verdict-round4":"(a) and (b) HOLD at 3b69f56c — kinds required and spent at every site, the separator refusals pinned with the ordinary composition beside them, the pin follows #2222 home. One SHOULD: stale header lines survive at plugin-kolu kinds.ts:27 and :98 and the odu twin kinds.ts:34. Comment 5479982653."}}
{"id":"lane-plug-review-b","parent":"plugin-system","ord":"a3","title":"review: pi #infra","done":"2026-08-31T10:44:20-04:00","started":"2026-08-31T10:38:34-04:00","worked":2543,"after":["lane-plug-refactor"],"created":"2026-08-30T10:39:32-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T10:44:20-04:00","custom":{"kolu-terminal":"194a2910","musts":"0","reviewer":"agent-pi","shoulds":"2","verdict":"merge — the pin exact-frozen, the absent-state tests TRUE absent (tag-set equality both directions), kinds built≠enabled, the rosters lid catches renames, prefs honest, flag parse loud. SHOULDs: the home-manager module lacks the plugins option (the nix half of the ruled CLI/nix-only shape, #434's mirror); fence.test.ts:78 cites a companion sweep that does not exist. NIT: the dated 'still a DRAFT' comment in nix/kolu.nix. Comment 5472844791.","verdict-followup":"round 2 at fa0471b5: merge — all three findings closed (the nix option's three arms mutation-tested, the transpiler sweep verified, the pin at kolu's final head with the shorter residue list); the round's extra half (the subscribe licence + the @plugins:odu live scenario) verified too. Comment 5473050110.","verdict-round3":"merge at b631f3b1 (round 3) — the six claims verified, one probe (the round's five core test files 86/86). SHOULD 1: ops/standing.ts:166 + ops/tools.ts:291 — the kinds params never passed at the only two production call sites (NO_KINDS defeats the claimed compiler enumeration); page/gate vs search/filter-box read different declaration layers. SHOULD 2: stale kinds.ts headers in both plugins assert the claim IS TERMINAL_KEY — pre-amendment design contradicted by the code. 4 NITs: two verbatim doc dups, the worktrees.ts declares-nothing sentence, the typing.ts memo header. Comment 5479641702.","verdict-round4":"confirmed at 3b69f56c — all four NITs in plus the README survivor, the pin API-verified byte-identical to the #2222 squash, nix/kolu.nix unfrozen to master. One SHOULD: the odu twin sentence at plugin-odu kinds.ts:34-36 still asserts the claim IS WORKTREE_KEY; one new NIT: NO_KINDS imported unused at ops/tools.ts:112. Comment on pi's round-3 thread."}}
