{"id":"lane-appliance-fold-merge-master","parent":"appliance-fold","ord":"a4","title":"merge latest master into the PR #infra","cancelled":"2026-08-31T23:37:08-04:00","desc":"SKIPPED, not forgotten: master has not moved since the branch was cut — origin/master is 12b3b6ad and the head is 0 commits behind it, so this would be an empty merge commit. The step's purpose (the watcher tests the code as it will actually land) is already satisfied, because the head's base IS current master. If master moves before the merge, this is re-opened and run.","after":["lane-appliance-fold-review-a","lane-appliance-fold-review-b"],"created":"2026-08-31T20:37:40-04:00","changed":"2026-08-31T23:37:08-04:00"}
