{"id":"cordis-spike","parent":"infra-build","ord":"aD","title":"Draft PR: the Cordis spike #infra","done":"2026-09-02T11:45:30-04:00","started":"2026-09-02T11:09:37-04:00","worked":2153,"desc":"§6 phase 1 delivered at draft PR #472 @ cf861a31 (10m44s): Cordis pinned via npins (not copied) and hydrated like @odu/run-client; olai-plugin-odu mounts as a fiber; ctx.surfaces re-composes on register/dispose; the three properties hold in tests. §8 answered with honest nos — live sibling add/drop needs a reconnect (the @kolu/surface ask, to file first); HMR cache clearing does not work under Bun. VERDICT: phase 2 warranted — with named don'ts (no HMR yet, no intercept in the store, no PluginServices dissolution until re-compose is the root's own). The PR stays DRAFT and OPEN as the record; grok's terminal kept warm for the human's follow-ups.","created":"2026-09-02T11:09:27-04:00","changed":"2026-09-02T11:45:30-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-grok","brief":"briefs/cordis-spike.md","dispatched":"2026-09-02T11:16:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-02: dispatch the spike of brainstorming/cordis-for-olai.md to opencode — no review, draft PR, left open","kolu-terminal":"129bd22d","merge":"merge-human","odu-worktree":".worktrees/cordis-spike","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/472","tier":"ordinary"}}
