{"id":"lane-pae-implement","parent":"plugin-api-effect","ord":"a0","title":"implement + open PR #infra","done":"2026-09-02T22:47:18-04:00","started":"2026-09-02T21:23:15-04:00","worked":5043,"desc":"Opened https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/483 @ f4d36a75 at 22:45 ET (1h22m): apply is an Effect on its own Scope, services are Context tags, packages/effect-cordis is the only package naming cordis (both halves, so the fence's arm narrows to one package); the three bridges gone (Effect.promise around the mount, the ring callbacks and the Log service, hand-reaching plugin bodies); a real bug found on the way (Held's door minted per call, so its promised write ordering was not happening — fixed, with a case). Flagged in the body: the vault doors are awaited Effect handlers rather than Streams (ordering with the root's own writes outranked the shape); eventStream not built (no fire-and-forget event left). 5337 unit, prove-fence 15/15 incl. the new mutation 16, four one-off e2e scenarios green.","after":["lane-pd-merge"],"created":"2026-09-02T20:46:12-04:00","changed":"2026-09-02T22:47:18-04:00"}
