{"id":"agents-as-plugins","parent":"infra-build","ord":"aJ","title":"PR: agents as plugins #infra","done":"2026-09-03T12:17:12-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T07:21:58-04:00","worked":17714,"desc":"Phase 5 of brainstorming/cordis-for-olai.md §6: one plugin per engine (`packages/plugins/claude|opencode|pi`), never a roster plugin; a new `Agents` tag in plugin-api registered from the fiber's name; `KINDS` and the `AGENTS` union deleted, the engine list becomes data the server sends; each engine's adapter pin and patches travel into its plugin directory; the session-start door finished (no self-signed name, no promise). Done means and bans per the brief. The human's order 2026-09-03 ~07:15 ET: dispatch to Claude Opus, manual merge, ONLY AFTER #483 (the plugin API is Effect) merges — the implement step's `after` edge carries it.","see":["plugin-api-effect","cordis-server"],"created":"2026-09-03T07:15:42-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T12:17:12-04:00","custom":{"agent":"agent-claude-opus","brief":"briefs/agents-as-plugins.md","dispatched":"2026-09-03T07:22:00-04:00","from":"the human 2026-09-03 ~07:15 ET: dispatch phase 5 of cordis-for-olai.md to Claude Opus, manual merge, after plugin-api-effect merges","kolu-terminal":"3c6db249","merge":"merge-human","odu-worktree":".worktrees/agents-as-plugins","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/486","tier":"design-heavy"}}
{"id":"lane-aap-implement","parent":"agents-as-plugins","ord":"a0","title":"implement + open PR #infra","done":"2026-09-03T09:04:36-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T07:21:58-04:00","worked":6158,"desc":"Reported 09:03 ET after 1h40m: #486 @ 74a9e8fa. Three engine directories and three rows; a new `Agents` tag; three browser slots (chat.speaker.mark, chat.agent.row, chat.agent.install); KINDS, the AGENTS union, MARKS and WHERE_FROM gone; the legs and Claude's model bets moved into their engines; Leg/Adapter/Where/NotHere down to a new `@olai/acp/engine` door; patches per engine, nix/acp-agent.nix parameterised by the row. Green locally: typecheck, 5379 unit, six check legs, nix build, 16/16 prove-fence, 170 e2e scenarios. Two deferrals argued in the body. THE SESSION ENDED THE TURN AT 97% OF ITS 1M CONTEXT.","after":["lane-pae-merge"],"created":"2026-09-03T07:15:42-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T09:04:36-04:00","custom":{"pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/486"}}
{"id":"lane-aap-refactor","parent":"agents-as-plugins","ord":"a1","title":"refactor passes #infra","done":"2026-09-03T11:04:05-04:00","started":"2026-09-03T09:09:26-04:00","worked":6879,"desc":"**TL;DR.** Eight refactor passes landed, head bfe2fda2, reported 11:02 ET after 1h17m; one behaviour change (the no-agent face names which of three things happened, with an e2e scenario), the rest structure. Green after each pass by the author's report.\n\n**The passes.** chat.agent.row slot deleted (all three faces drew core's fallback around the server's string); the no-agent face says which of three things happened; Registering.missing deleted; inBundleOrder written once; Plugins.contributing() replaces the server's hand-written registry union; the install row's strokes are core's, the plugin brings the words; a dead re-export, a broken sentinel and an uncancellable delay removed; docs aligned.\n\n**The human's order, answered.** The human told the author directly that claude, pi and opencode must be enabled by default. The author verified all three rows already are (only xyne-spaces carries `disabled: true`) and changed nothing there.\n\n**Gates by the author's report.** typecheck, 5479 unit tests, fmt-check, the three deps checks, hm-module, bun-nix-fresh, nix build, 16/16 prove-fence mutations, 171 e2e scenarios across the four session features.","after":["lane-aap-implement"],"created":"2026-09-03T07:15:42-04:00","changed":"2026-09-03T11:04:05-04:00"}
