{"id":"vib-2-tags","parent":"vault-in-browser","ord":"a1","title":"PR 2 — tag completion's vocabulary becomes a server question; the local taggedBy walk dies in the same diff #performance","done":"2026-08-20T02:32:01-04:00","after":["search-server-side"],"created":"2026-08-19T20:46:18-04:00","changed":"2026-08-20T02:32:01-04:00","custom":{"from":"brainstorming/vault-in-browser.md §6","merge-commit":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/commit/17ada1e1","pr-url":"https://github.com/juspay/olai/pull/272"}}
